# Intent CAS (writing/dropping `intent` on a `RangeEntry`), child cleanup paths
# (`discard_range_db`, `discard_child_now`, `discard_abandoned_child`,
# `discard_orphan`) and close-mark removals (`reopen_range_db`, `reopen_range_db_at`)
# **outside** `crates/cairn-server/src/split/` — a list frozen on 2026-10-18. Read
# by `scripts/lint-sources.sh` (check 7).
#
# Line: <max count> <path> <note>. Above the count ⇒ FAIL. Every site below
# executes a `Plan` it has just asked `cairn_split::step` for.

2 crates/cairn-server/src/ctl.rs               `intent clear`: CAS dropping the intent after `Found(Ctl)`, child cleanup after `Cleared` (Remover::Ctl)
1 crates/cairn-server/src/gc.rs                orphan child cleanup round: `discard_child_now` after `Discard(OrphanRound|OwnOrphans)` = `DiscardDb`
1 crates/cairn-server/src/node/spawner.rs      `heal_stale_close`: removes a stale close mark after `StaleClose` = `ReopenAtMark`
